  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nurture Zimbabwe: Neotree Technology Enabled Newborn Care and Research Project.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the scale-up of a proven low-cost clinical decision support tool that will contribute towards the reduction of newborn mortality.  Implementation will take place in two further central hospital sites- Mbuya Nehanda Hospital in Harare and Bindura Hospital in Mashonaland Central. The platform of four central hospitals will be used to demonstrate the nationwide potential of this technology and further develop the suite of Neotree decision tools. The project will support the testing and integration of a machine learning algorithm that will help health workers to identify neonatal sepsis, respiratory distress, and neonatal encephalopathy (brain damage).</narrative>
  </description>
